Option 1: Pass default=str to json.dumps:
   json.dumps(data, default=str)

Option 2: Use custom JSONEncoder:
   import json
   from datetime import datetime
   class DateTimeEncoder(json.JSONEncoder):
       def default(self, o):
           if isinstance(o, datetime):
               return o.isoformat()
           return super().default(o)
   json.dumps(data, cls=DateTimeEncoder)

Option 3: If using Pydantic / FastAPI, use model_dump(mode='json')
